 *
 * aen-camera-firstlight board overlay for the E1M-AEN803 (Ensemble E8,
 * M55-HE) RAM-run.
 *
 * No camera-specific DT wiring lives here: the CSI-2 -> CPI graph (dphy /
 * csi / cam, all status="okay") and the sensor node itself come from the
 * two shields stacked at build time (`-DSHIELD="e1m_evk_rpi_csi <camera
 * shield>"`) -- see zephyr/boards/shields/e1m_evk_rpi_csi/ and the sensor
 * shield's own overlay. This file only carries the RAM-run retarget every
 * sibling *-regcheck / *-firstlight bench app needs.
 */

/*
 * RAM-run: retarget ROM to ITCM (path-reference form &itcm; the phandle-array
 * form makes FLASH_SIZE=0 and overflows the link).
 */
/ {
	chosen {
		zephyr,flash = &itcm;
		/delete-property/ zephyr,code-partition;
	};
};
